<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="7c43053">Complex programs have a lot of moving parts and therefore it&amp;nbsp;is necessary to make assumptions around information that
may be unknown or difficult to fully validate. In addition, some of these assumptions around the costs or benefits may be
impacted by other factors and therefore, it is important to try and identify potential risks and issues so they can be
mitigated or managed effectively.</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="e147179d"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="bc044629"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="b41ea6fb"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="a2e32562">To document assumptions and identify risks and issues.</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="c79fb38b"></attribute>
