<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="839e3d5f"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="778b9621">&lt;p&gt;
    A program or project carries on for a significant period of time, and it is important that assumptions and their
    explanations are thoroughly documented so that they can be referred to and understood even if the author or
    contributors are no longer involved. Assumptions should be considered for each of the cost components including:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Baseline assumptions
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Modeling of future state
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Assumptions relating to implementation costs
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Impact of future business growth
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Inflation factor
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Impact of other planned initiatives&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
