<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="b00b0cf8">&lt;p&gt;
    It is likely that throughout the course of the program/project, a number of potential risks and issues are identified.
    These should be captured and reviewed with key program stakeholders. Risks should be identified both in relation to the
    potential benefits as well as the costs.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
