<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="6dd96c47">Risks and issues should be categorized in relation to their likelihood, proximity, impact and the level of control that the
program/project has in mitigating it. If a risk scores highly, it may be appropriate to make an adjustment to the projected
benefits or costs.</attribute>
